{"lines":[{"y":0.052325581147404265,"t":"Introduction","x":0.80968858107835517,"w":0.1038062286376954,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1},{"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?","w":0.25086504618326821,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"y":0.10029069774642962,"x":0.19204152526476728},{"t":"IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall","x":0.18853878451665707,"y":0.13806154978761309,"h":0.019280517076261439,"c":1,"w":0.6506146240234375},{"t":"language ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills","x":0.18849776299239873,"w":0.69568288167317716,"y":0.15524011258029846,"c":1,"h":0.022789044176639517},{"h":0.019430354727657639,"t":"(Listening, Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band","y":0.1757044052526755,"c":1,"x":0.18854334233748923,"w":0.71461898803710933},{"x":0.19031140751680237,"y":0.1947674415788172,"w":0.71972320556640623,"t":"scale. All scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's","h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1},{"h":0.017441861023846261,"y":0.2136627904158459,"c":1,"t":"nationality, first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a","w":0.68166091918945315,"x":0.19031140882794659},{"y":0.23093072110500201,"x":0.19031140760393092,"h":0.017615790797581243,"c":1,"t":"descriptive statement which gives a summary of the English-language ability of a candidate","w":0.71972320556640634},{"c":1,"w":0.67666356404622396,"t":"classified at that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","x":0.19021745096459938,"y":0.24654002419031962,"h":0.022251937337652516},{"h":0.014534882851794939,"y":0.54069767473204822,"c":1,"x":0.19031141905785356,"w":0.013840829531351739,"t":"5"},{"c":1,"t":"4","h":0.014534882851794828,"y":0.60610465149353787,"x":0.18858131461364239,"w":0.015570934613545723},{"y":0.2979651159941501,"t":"Expert user - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate","c":1,"w":0.67820068359374996,"h":0.01744186102384615,"x":0.22145329130651248},{"c":1,"w":0.32559099833170579,"h":0.019270004635511206,"x":0.22996753742032874,"t":"and fluent with complete understanding.","y":0.31519542990314298},{"t":"Very good user - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional","x":0.22837370975835711,"w":0.68685119628906244,"h":0.017441861023846261,"c":1,"y":0.34447674390368466},{"h":0.017441861023846261,"c":1,"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in","y":0.3633720927404438,"w":0.62802769978841155,"x":0.23010379711230436},{"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"y":0.38226744157815395,"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","x":0.23010380482453419,"w":0.53806228637695308},{"x":0.23010380032615843,"w":0.63667821248372403,"y":0.40972708211878928,"h":0.019051987612639598,"c":1,"t":"Good user - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional"},{"w":0.64894577026367184,"h":0.02199287561372576,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally","y":0.42617958073409135,"c":1,"x":0.22830790606121507},{"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning.","w":0.54337402343749996,"y":0.44554869470181313,"x":0.23003908299279582,"h":0.020246642548525706,"c":1},{"x":0.21799307486238242,"y":0.47515745260255549,"w":0.66782007853190106,"h":0.017575105809931824,"t":"Competent user - Has generally effective command of the language despite some","c":1},{"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","y":0.49265220459994041,"w":0.66262975056966145,"h":0.018975702343160594,"c":1,"x":0.22837370593973},{"t":"complex language, particularly in familiar situations.","w":0.41192888895670576,"y":0.51070518377902374,"c":1,"h":0.020691824259667868,"x":0.2300098072094974},{"w":0.66435984293619799,"h":0.017551711758506117,"c":1,"t":"Modest user - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning","x":0.21799308882601867,"y":0.5405878234021706},{"w":0.66608998616536463,"h":0.018952308291734887,"c":1,"t":"in most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle","x":0.22837369196214846,"y":0.55808257539496309},{"y":0.57697690716521188,"x":0.23010380892913398,"t":"basic communication in own field.","h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"w":0.26989618937174475},{"w":0.62802769978841144,"t":"Limited user - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent","x":0.21972317423448573,"y":0.6060181945546439,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1},{"t":"problems in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","y":0.62491252631714156,"x":0.228373707872492,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.64013839721679688,"c":1},{"y":0.65255423389803902,"w":0.65397923787434897,"x":0.21626297612795875,"h":0.017503905913644702,"t":"Extremely limited user - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very","c":1},{"w":0.52076126098632813,"x":0.22837369466638241,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","c":1,"y":0.67004898558038017},{"y":0.69909027292969872,"h":0.017494751574527734,"c":1,"x":0.21799308316566945,"w":0.66262975056966145,"t":"Intermittent user - Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English."},{"w":0.64532872517903639,"c":1,"h":0.017507974879569899,"y":0.72813156028101,"t":"Non-user - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few","x":0.21280276535190676},{"y":0.74559379461456821,"w":0.12503682454427084,"h":0.016174735515746663,"x":0.22817997622389641,"t":"isolated words.","c":1},{"w":0.47404846191406247,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"x":0.21453286237923294,"t":"Did not attempt the test - Did not answer the questions.","y":0.77466759998035462},{"c":1,"w":0.013840829531351795,"y":0.95203488401014902,"t":"7","x":0.89619377201633099,"h":0.014534882851794828}],"w":2400,"h":2857}